OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CToday:FThe weekend will get off to a   
OL,6,Fgrey start with the odd spot of        
OL,7,Fdrizzle. Outbreaks of sometimes        
OL,8,Fheavier and generally more persistent  
OL,9,Frain will arrive from the south        
OL,10,Fthrough the morning, leading into a    
OL,11,Fwet and rather windy afternoon.        
OL,13,CTonight:FThe evening will start        
OL,14,Fcloudy, though rain will turn          
OL,15,Fincreasingly patchy. Some clear spells 
OL,16,Fare likely overnight, though a few     
OL,17,Fshowers are still likely, and it will  
OL,18,Fremain breezy.                         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
