OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CSunday:FOn the whole Sunday promises   
OL,6,Fto be a brighter day than Saturday,    
OL,7,Falthough a scattering of showers are   
OL,8,Flikely to feed across the region in    
OL,9,Fthe southwesterly breeze.              
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,12,Fand Tuesday look milder, though cloudy 
OL,13,Fwith rain at times, some heavy. Windy  
OL,14,Ffor a while too. A fresher, sunnier    
OL,15,Fday's expected on Wednesday, with the  
OL,16,Fchance of showers.                     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
